{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02337","headline":"杂歌谣辞 鸡鸣曲 · 李廓","name":"杂歌谣辞 鸡鸣曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"星稀月没上五更，胶胶角角鸡初鸣。\n征人牵马出门立，辞妾欲向安西行。\n再鸣引颈檐头下，月中角声催上马。\n才分地色第三鸣，旌旗红尘已出城。\n妇人上城乱招手，夫壻不闻遥哭声。\n长恨鸡鸣别时苦，不遣鸡栖近窗户。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李廓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02337.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02337","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}